		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Plundered from the depths of legend, the &0Black Eye&r once granted the Black Pearl its ghostly sight-guiding it through storms, shadows, and uncharted waters.  "
				"Forging this mythical artifact will require your mastery of &lMechanical Crafting&r, using the ancient recipe shown below.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_black_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Each sacred component lies hidden within the cursed pirate ships scattered across the Seven Seas, brought forth by the mod &6When Dungeons Arise: Seven Seas&r.  "
				"The next few pages will guide you to each relic needed to awaken the Black Eye."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lBlackbeard’s Musket&r, a legendary firearm said to echo with the roar of the high seas, can be found within the treacherous halls of the &ePirate Junk&r.  "
				"Forged for fear rather than finesse, it was a symbol of terror worth a king’s ransom.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/junk_ship.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lBlackbeard’s Cutlass&r, a fearsome blade that sailed across countless bloody raids, rests aboard the mighty &eVictory Frigate&r.  "
				"Its edge has tasted gold, command, and countless tales of the high seas. Few who crossed its path lived to tell the tale.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/frigate.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lCursed Cannonballs&r, heavy iron relics of devastation, are said to be found within the &eCorsair Corvette&r or the ghostly &eUnicorn Galleon&r.  "
				"Each cannonball carries not just brute force-but the weight of dread, leaving behind echoes of thunder and ghostly flames.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/corvette.png width:100 height:100 align:center}  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/unicorn.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nPrepare yourself before venturing into these haunted ships.&r  "
				"They are heavily fortified with treacherous spawners, summoning ruthless pirate crews, spectral guardians, and ancient curses.  "
				"Only the bravest-and the cleverest-will claim the fragments needed to forge the Black Eye and command the shadows of the seas!"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:black_eye"
