		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Born from the fiery clash between the Aether and the Nether, the &cNether Eye&r is a relic of unimaginable power-a fragment of war and dominion that once shaped the realms themselves.  "
				"To claim this artifact, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and retrieve ancient treasures long buried in flame and ruin.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_nether_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The components needed to forge the Nether Eye lie scattered across the Nether’s most treacherous ruins.  "
				"The next pages will guide you through the infernal journey ahead."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lHades' Bident&r:  "
				"  A weapon of judgment forged in the deepest fires of the underworld. Legends claim the very earth splits beneath its strike.  "
				"  Seek this fearsome relic within the ruins of the &eAncient Portal Structure&r, from the mod &cIntegrated Dungeons and Structures (IDAS).  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/nether_portal.png width:150 height:115 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lAncient Obol&r:  "
				"  A single coin said to bear the weight of eternity itself-the fare for crossing into the afterlife.  "
				"  It can be found within the forgotten &eHopo's Piglin Ruin&r, buried among the relics of those who once sought passage between worlds.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/piglin_ruin.png width:150 height:115 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lCerberus’s Fang&r:  "
				"  Torn from the maw of the infernal guardian of the underworld, this fang pulses with eternal fury and vigilance.  "
				"  Seek it within the fiery halls of the &eQuartz Kitchen&r, a twisted structure born of &cIncendium’s&r corrupted Nether landscapes.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/kitchen.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nSteel yourself for this journey across flame and fury.&r  "
				"The Nether Eye is a relic not easily claimed. Its pieces are guarded by forces both ancient and wrathful-and the price of failure is steep.  "
				"Only those who conquer fire, fury, and temptation will earn the Demon’s Gaze and hold the power to shape realms anew."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:nether_eye"
				tag: {
