		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Torn from the abyssal depths, the &3Guardian Eye&r is a relic that has borne witness to countless warriors dragged beneath the waves.  "
				"It glistens with sorrow and power-the eternal memory of the ocean's silent grasp.  "
				"To forge this watery talisman, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and reclaim the treasures guarded fiercely beneath the sea.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_guardian_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The ocean hides more than shipwrecks and ruins-it harbors ancient guardians and treasures untouched by the sun.  "
				"The following pages will chart your path into the deep."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lGuardian Soup&r:  "
				"  A potent broth crafted from the remains of fallen Guardians, mixed with rare ingredients from the depths.  "
				"  Slay Guardians and gather the bounty needed at the &eOcean Monuments&r, reimagined by &eBetter Oceans Monuments&r.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/guardian.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lCabbage Wrapped Elder Guardian&r:  "
				"  A rare delicacy crafted from slices of Elder Guardians-creatures whose bulk and fury once terrified the seas.  "
				"  Elder Guardian slices can be obtained only by killing Elder Guardians with a precise &eKnife&r.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/elder.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lSponges&r:  "
				"  Ancient sponges, capable of absorbing the very life of the ocean, can be recovered from the hidden chambers within the &eBetter Oceans Monuments&r.  "
				"  These natural relics hold the spirit of the drowned and are essential in the Eye's restoration.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/sponge.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nThe ocean remembers.&r  "
				"To forge the Guardian Eye, you must brave the depths, face down ancient titans, and claim the sorrowful treasures of the abyss.  "
				"Only those who embrace the ocean’s trials-without fear of its grasp-will awaken the power hidden within its tears."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:guardian_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
