		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Glittering with the allure of the unknown, the &bAetheric Eye&r has guided countless explorers to their destinies-some to treasures hidden within the &eCataclysm Acropolis&r, others to fates lost beneath its storm-shrouded halls."
				"It shimmers with elemental power and whispers of secrets long drowned by the tides."
				"To forge this artifact of discovery, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and brave the ancient ruins where storms rage eternal."
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_exotic_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Aetheric Eye is not gifted by fortune-it must be claimed through strength, sacrifice, and mastery of the storm."
				"The following pages will reveal the path to awakening its shimmering light."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEssence of the Storm&r:"
				"The raw breath of a sea tempest, ripped from the heart of &eScylla&r-the guardian of the Acropolis."
				"Only by defeating this monstrous horror can you harvest the &eEssence of the Storm&r, a keystone in the Eye’s awakening."
				"{image:ftb:textures/scylla_2.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEye of Storm&r:"
				"Born not in battle, but through artifice."
				"A &eSequenced Assembly&r upon an &eEye of Ender&r will reveal it, using:"
				""
				"A &eConduit&r,"
				""
				"A &eSea Lantern&r,"
				""
				"Washed in &eSpouting Water&r,"
				""
				"Then sealed with the press of automation."
				"{image:cataclysm:item/storm_eye width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lLacrima&r:"
				"Crystallized sorrow shed by the Acropolis itself."
				"It may be uncovered within its storm-drowned chests, or torn from the essence of any creature that dares to lurk within its halls."
				"{image:cataclysm:item/lacrima width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lChitin Claw&r:"
				"A jagged fragment from the armored grasp of the &eClawdian&r."
				"Only those who fell the clawed sentinel of the Acropolis will hold this token of conquest."
				"{image:cataclysm:item/chitin_claw width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lUndead Soul&r:"
				"A whisper of the drowned, bound within the Acropolis’s cursed warriors."
				"This essence is all that remains of those claimed by the sea, and it answers only to those who strike them down."
				"{image:endrem:item/undead_soul width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nThe storm keeps its secrets-but you must seize them.&r"
				"The Aetheric Eye glimmers not for the timid, but for those who conquer the wrath of the Acropolis and bind its relics into their command."
				"Only the bold who withstand the sea’s fury will awaken its guiding light."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:exotic_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "10232D5D9959E8A5"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "139E6F23A81A2865"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "cataclysm:chitin_claw"
						tag: { }
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0EBCFD7E1B94ED0E"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 5
				}
			]
			subtitle: "Forge the &bAetheric Eye&r and uncover the secrets bound within the Acropolis. Click me for more info!."
			tasks: [
				{
					icon: {
						Count: 1
						id: "cataclysm:storm_eye"
						tag: { }
					}
					id: "273880B23E215E5A"
					structure: "cataclysm:acropolis"
					title: "Locate Acropolis"
					type: "structure"
				}
				{
					id: "312555A90021D29F"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "endrem:exotic_eye"
						tag: {
							Damage: 0
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "26548543E300B980"
					item: "cataclysm:lacrima"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Mysteries of the Storm"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Shrouded in enigmatic energies, the &5Cryptic Eye&r is a relic that whispers truths no mortal was ever meant to know.  "
				"Its gaze pierces the veil of reality itself, unraveling forgotten secrets and forbidden knowledge.  "
				"To forge this mysterious artifact, you must master the art of &lAncient Enchanting&r, calling upon power both perilous and profound.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_enchanting_cryptic_eye.png width:175 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Unlike other relics, the Cryptic Eye cannot simply be found-it must be awakened through a ritual of focus, knowledge, and risk.  "
				"The pages ahead will guide you through the sacred process."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lRitual of the Eye&r:  "
				"  Begin by crafting a standard &eEye of Ender&r, a symbol of perception and power.  "
				"  Then, prepare an ancient enchanting altar as follows:  "
				"  - Surround your Enchanting Table with &e8 Apotheosis Hellshelves&r, brimming with unstable, infernal energy.  "
				"  - Place &e8 Standard Bookshelves&r to anchor the ritual in mortal understanding.  "
				"  - Adorn the altar with &e2 sets of 4 Candles&r to focus the energies at the heart of the ritual.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/eye_enchanting.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lThe Enchantment&r:  "
				"  With your altar prepared, offer 40 full levels of experience to the Enchanting Table while holding your Eye of Ender.  "
				"  If fate favors you, and the energies align, the Eye will be transformed-ripped from the mundane and born anew as the &5Cryptic Eye&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nBut beware&r-this ritual stirs forces beyond comprehension.  "
				"The Cryptic Eye does not merely reveal hidden truths-it tests the will of those who seek to wield them.  "
				"Only the wise, the patient, and the daring will endure its gaze and emerge with knowledge once thought lost forever."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:cryptic_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
