		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Torn from the depths of the ancient darkness, the &9Warden's Eye&r burns with sorrow and silence.  "
				"Taken centuries ago from a creature now doomed to wander blindly through eternal night, this relic pulses with lost grief and forgotten strength.  "
				"To forge the Warden's Eye, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and recover fragments of a being never meant to be disturbed.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_undead_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The relics you seek are hidden within the ancient ruins of civilization's last breath-and guarded by a titan whose sorrow shakes the earth itself.  "
				"The following pages will guide you into the abyss."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lWarden Carapace&r:  "
				"  A hardened fragment of the Warden's monstrous form, imbued with the echoes of countless battles.  "
				"  Defeat the Warden to claim this precious shard of the abyss.  "
				"{image:deeperdarker:item/warden_carapace width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lWarden Tendril&r:  "
				"  A tendril steeped in darkness and sensory magic, vital to the Warden’s ability to hunt in blindness.  "
				"  Slay the Warden to rip this twisted appendage from its form.  "
				"{image:apotheosis:items/warden_tendril width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lWarden Ear&r:  "
				"  A relic of ancient hearing, attuned to the faintest vibrations of the world.  "
				"  Recovered only by defeating the Warden in its own domain-the silent ruins of the Deep Dark.  "
				"{image:silentsdelight:item/warden_ear width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lHeart of the Deep&r and &lWarden Heart&r:  "
				"  The very core of the Warden’s existence, pulsing with sorrow and unspoken rage.  "
				"  Only through triumph over the Warden’s wrath can these hearts be claimed.  "
				"{image:silentsdelight:item/warden_heart width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lEcho Shard&r:  "
				"  Silent fragments of forgotten knowledge, still humming with the faint vibrations of the Deep Dark.  "
				"  Found within the loot caches of the ancient cities buried beneath the earth.  "
				"{image:minecraft:item/echo_shard width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nTo forge the Warden's Eye is to tread upon sorrow itself.&r  "
				"The Deep Dark does not forgive intruders lightly-and the Warden remembers.  "
				"Only those who brave the silence, conquer despair, and honor the forgotten will ignite the Eye’s somber flame."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:undead_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "7B7C6A4F2D966F69"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
