		{
			description: [
				"Brimming with the remnants of the Evoker’s lost power, the &dMagical Eye&r pulses with chaotic energy.  "
				"It is a fragment of ancient, forgotten magic-capable of shaping the world in ways few can comprehend.  "
				"To forge this wondrous relic, you must master the art of &lArcane Enchanting&r, binding a spark of immortality into something far more potent.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_enchanting_magical_eye.png width:175 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Unlike relics bound by stone and steel, the Magical Eye is born through an enchantment ritual-requiring focus, power, and a heart defiant of death itself.  "
				"The following pages will guide you through the arcane rite."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lRitual of the Totem&r:  "
				"  Begin by preparing a &eTotem of Undying&r, an artifact imbued with the gift of second chances.  "
				"  Then construct your ancient enchanting altar:  "
				"  - Surround the Enchanting Table with &e8 Apotheosis Hellshelves&r, amplifying the ritual’s magical resonance.  "
				"  - Place &e8 Standard Bookshelves&r to stabilize and balance the energies.  "
				"  - Arrange &e2 sets of 4 Candles&r to channel the forces into the heart of the ritual.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/eye_enchanting.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lThe Enchantment&r:  "
				"  With your altar prepared, offer 40 full levels of experience at the Enchanting Table while holding the Totem of Undying.  "
				"  If your will is strong and your focus unwavering, the Totem will transform-becoming the &dMagical Eye&r, a vessel of untamed arcane might."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nBut tread carefully, for power demands a price.&r  "
				"The Magical Eye is no mere trinket; it holds echoes of the Evoker’s ambitions and hubris.  "
				"Only those worthy of wielding ancient forces will master its gift and carry the Evoker’s Heart into a new age."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:magical_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "72DBFC6476091A3A"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
