		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"A remnant of ancient alchemy, the &5Witch Eye&r once gleamed with forbidden knowledge of brewing arts lost to time.  "
				"It holds within it a spark of mastery-an understanding of transformation and power that few dare even whisper of today.  "
				"To forge this artifact of ancient wisdom, you must master &lSuper Heated Mixing&r and gather relics born from flame, soul, and brew.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mixing_witch_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The path to the Witch Eye is not one of brute strength, but of cleverness, patience, and alchemical prowess.  "
				"The following pages will unveil the arcane steps needed."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lBlaze Gold Block&r:  "
				"  A rare alloy formed by consuming the very soul of a Blaze with the power of Chromatic Compound.  "
				"  Right-click a Blaze while holding &eChromatic Compound&r to bind its burning essence into the golden material.  "
				"{image:ftbchunks:textures/faces/minecraft/blaze.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lPotion of Lava Vision&r:  "
				"  Crafted through secretive brews, this potion grants sight through molten depths.  "
				"  Brew it by:  "
				"  - Heated Mixing &eLava Bottles&r with &eBone Serpent Teeth&r (from Alex’s Mobs).  "
				"  - Then, Heated Mixing in &eRedstone Dust&r to extend the potion's duration.  "
				"{image:alexsmobs:item/lava_bottle width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lPotion of Soul Steel&r:  "
				"  A potion that hardens the soul itself into an indomitable force.  "
				"  Brew it by:  "
				"  - Heated Mixing an &eAwkward Potion&r (created by mixing Water Bottles and Nether Warts) with &eSoul Vulture Hearts&r (from Alex’s Mobs).  "
				"  - Then, Heated Mixing in &eGlowstone Dust&r to strengthen its potency.  "
				"{image:alexsmobs:item/soul_heart width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nTrue mastery lies not just in strength-but in understanding transformation.&r  "
				"The Witch Eye demands cleverness, patience, and the courage to wield forces forgotten by the world.  "
				"Only those who brew with precision, and command the elements of fire, soul, and spirit, will ignite its hidden knowledge."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:witch_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "6D1F1DB7B6A3DA79"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
