		}
		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"A witness to the fall of empires, the &8Wither Eye&r bears the scars of a thousand lost worlds.  "
				"It gazes into the abyss of ruin itself, holding echoes of devastation and power beyond reckoning.  "
				"To forge this relic of destruction, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and gather the remnants of battles that shook the realms.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_wither_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The path to the Wither Eye is not one of creation-it is one of conquest, sacrifice, and decay.  "
				"The following pages will guide you into the heart of ruin."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lSoul Sand&r:  "
				"  A cursed earth infused with sorrow, Soul Sand can be unearthed in the depths of the Nether.  "
				"  Alternatively, you can create it by &eHaunting ordinary Sand&r with the echoes of the spirit realm.  "
				"{image:minecraft:block/soul_sand width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lWither Skeleton Skulls&r:  "
				"  Remnants of ancient battles fought against death incarnate.  "
				"  These can be claimed by &eBeheading Wither Skeletons&r, grim trophies from the shadows of fortress ruins.  "
				"{image:ftbchunks:textures/faces/minecraft/wither_skeleton.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lStar Infused Netherite Nugget&r:  "
				"  A forbidden alloy, forged from celestial devastation.  "
				"  Create this ingot by combining:  "
				"  - &e4 Nether Stars&r  "
				"  - &e1 Netherite Ingot&r  "
				"  into a single Star Infused Netherite Nugget.  "
				"  To harvest Nether Stars efficiently, consider using &eMob Cages&r to capture the Wither’s essence itself and automate its destruction.  "
				"{image:cagedmobs:item/star_infused_netherite_ingot width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nRuin is the price of power-and power the price of ruin.&r  "
				"The Wither Eye is a relic that remembers what the world has tried to forget.  "
				"Only those who embrace the cost of devastation and command the ashes of fallen realms will wield its hollow gaze."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:wither_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "6B63999D63EA981F"
