				"516CF2A060F13946"
				"29A5A4E4568E10F4"
				"43EFD816AF373F71"
			]
			description: [
				"Bound by the restless energy of countless spirits who refuse to pass on, the &7Undead Soul&r pulses with an eerie, unrelenting power.  "
				"It is a fragment of spectral might-a catalyst that bridges life, death, and destiny itself.  "
				"Forging this vital relic requires mastery of &lSuperheated Mixing&r and the careful union of sacred ingredients.  "
				"{image:endrem:item/undead_soul width:125 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The Undead Soul is no mere artifact; it is the heart of all that is yet to come. Without it, the legendary Eyes cannot be born.  "
				"The following page reveals the alchemical path to binding this restless spirit."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lSuperheated Ritual&r:  "
				"  Using the infernal fires of a Superheated Mixer, combine the sacred surrounding ingredients-each representing power, sorrow, knowledge, and ruin.  "
				"  Only in the heart of the hottest flame will these fragments surrender their essence to form the &7Undead Soul&r.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/blaze_burner_superheated.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nThe Undead do not rest-and neither must you.&r  "
				"The creation of the Undead Soul is the beginning of your true journey. With it, the Eyes of legend shall be reforged, each one carrying a spark of the restless beyond.  "
				"Embrace its haunting power and step beyond the boundaries of the living world."
			]
