		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Forged by the first blacksmiths at the dawn of creation, the &6Lost Eye&r stands as a testament to divine craftsmanship-an artifact glowing with the fire of the earth’s very soul.  "
				"To restore this ancient relic, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and gather remnants of a forgotten age.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_lost_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The pieces you seek are scattered between the molten depths of the Nether and the barren ruins of &cAd Astra’s Mars&r, where ancient battles of fire and stone still echo.  "
				"The next few pages will guide you to reclaim the tools of the ancients."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lInfernal Forge&r and &lMonstrous Horn&r:  "
				"  Both are prized trophies obtained by defeating the fearsome &eNetherite Monstrosity&r, a creature of molten rage found lurking within the &eSoul Blacksmith&r structure on Mars.  "
				"  Its defeat is no small feat-steel your spirit and prepare for battle against a relic of chaos.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/smith.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lChisel of the Deep Forge&r:  "
				"  Crafted in silence beneath the world’s crust, this legendary chisel shapes not just stone-but destiny itself.  "
				"  It can be unearthed from the sacred ruins hidden among &eMars Temple&r treasures.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/mars_temple.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lAncient Debris&r:  "
				"  Raw fragments of creation’s earliest forges, Ancient Debris can be found deep in the Nether, especially near &eDebris Molten Vents&r located on the Nether Roof, or naturally between &eY-Level 15&r and below.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/debris_vent.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nOnly those who can endure fire and fury may claim the Lost Eye.&r  "
				"The path will test your mettle, your will, and your soul. But those who succeed will wield a relic forged by gods-the ember of creation itself, reborn through your triumph."
			]
